cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this workshop or the Stockroom reference agent in teaching or research, please cite it."
title: "Evaluating Autonomous Agents: Systems, Harnesses & AWS Production CI/CD"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-07
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/genial-labs-ai/system_agent_harness_aws"
url: "https://github.com/genial-labs-ai/system_agent_harness_aws"
abstract: >-
  A four-day, hands-on workshop built around Stockroom, an inventory and order-support
  agent with deliberately seeded weaknesses. The thesis is Agent = Model + Harness: the
  eval suite exercises tool selection, arguments, trajectories, guards, context compaction
  and injection handling, not only final answers. Everything runs offline by default with a
  deterministic fake Bedrock client and judge; live mode runs the same code on Amazon Bedrock,
  gated in GitHub Actions through OIDC.
authors:
